  m_Name: LS_017_PRICES
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::LocalizedStringSO
  en: "The clients are ready. Their money is ready, but there's a tiny problem: you
    don't actually know what to charge them. I've pinged the price board for you.
    Go check the rates before the 'prey'\u2014 I mean, the customers\u2014get suspicious!
    Give the E-key a tap and memorize those digits. </color> Open the priceboard
    to look for prices <color=#FF9E3A> </color>"
